=== base ===
# Distribution Agreement

This Agreement is made between Hollins Craft Brewery Ltd (the "Supplier") and Ravelston Wines Ltd (the "Distributor").

## 4. Orders
4.1 The Distributor shall place orders in multiples of 24 cases.

## 9. Exclusivity
9.1 The Supplier shall not appoint any other distributor in Scotland.
9.2 The Distributor shall not sell competing craft beers in Scotland.
=== amendment ===
# Amendment No. 2

This Amendment is made on 2 May 2027 between Hollins Craft Brewery Ltd (the "Supplier") and Ravelston Wines Ltd (the "Distributor").

1. Clause 9 (Exclusivity) of the Agreement is deleted in its entirety.
